{"questions":[{"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"course":"core","subcategory":"hcf-lcm","skill":"poly-hcf-lcm-recover","stem":"The L.C.M. and H.C.F. of two polynomials are \\(2x(4x^2-1)(x^2-1)\\) and \\(x-1\\) respectively. One polynomial is \\(2x^3-x^2-2x+1\\). Find the other.","stemZh":"兩多項式的最小公倍式及最大公因式分別為 \\(2x(4x^2-1)(x^2-1)\\) 及 \\(x-1\\)。其中一式為 \\(2x^3-x^2-2x+1\\)，求另一式。","solution":"The given polynomial factors as \\((x-1)(x+1)(2x-1)\\). Use product of the two polynomials = H.C.F. × L.C.M. Cancelling gives \\[\\begin{gathered}2x(x-1)(2x+1) =4x^3 \\\\ -2x^2 -2x\\end{gathered}\\].","solutionZh":"已知式分解為 \\((x-1)(x+1)(2x-1)\\)。利用「兩式乘積＝最大公因式×最小公倍式」，約去因式後得 \\[\\begin{gathered}2x(x-1)(2x+1) =4x^3 \\\\ -2x^2 -2x\\end{gathered}\\]。","solutionStatus":"independently-rederived","source":"S4/more about polynomials/S4 polynomials review.pdf · Q8","sourceZh":"S4/more about polynomials/S4 polynomials review.pdf · 第8題","provenance":{"collection":"by-topic-review-materials","sourceId":"source-a11ea3a915f0b682","sha256":"641341ccab25c3ecd24c89de877aa77122fc326ddf7de3bbd74df10a8e926c97","file":"S4/more about polynomials/S4 polynomials review.pdf","number":"8","page":2,"attributionStatus":"not-supplied"},"classification":{"version":"solving-method-v1","basis":"reviewed-decisive-solving-method","status":"editor-pipeline-reviewed","difficultyReason":"Expand and collect the full expression before checking the requested structure.","evidence":"docs/qa/2026-11-16/hcf-wave/mathematics.json#source-a11ea3a915f0b682-Q8"},"level":"free","options":{"A":"\\[\\begin{gathered}x^3 \\\\ +x^2 -x\\end{gathered}\\]","B":"\\[\\begin{gathered}x^3 \\\\ -2x^2 \\\\ -2x\\end{gathered}\\]","C":"\\[\\begin{gathered}4x^3 \\\\ +x^2 -x\\end{gathered}\\]","D":"\\[\\begin{gathered}4x^3 \\\\ -2x^2 \\\\ -2x\\end{gathered}\\]"},"optionsZh":{"A":"\\[\\begin{gathered}x^3 \\\\ +x^2 -x\\end{gathered}\\]","B":"\\[\\begin{gathered}x^3 \\\\ -2x^2 \\\\ -2x\\end{gathered}\\]","C":"\\[\\begin{gathered}4x