:"Both \\(4x-6=0\\) and \\(3-2x=0\\) give \\(x=\\frac{3}{2}\\). The divisors share the same root, so both remainders equal \\(f(\\frac{3}{2})=8\\).","solutionZh":"\\(4x-6=0\\) 與 \\(3-2x=0\\) 都給 \\(x=\\frac{3}{2}\\)。兩個除式有同一個 root，所以餘式同為 \\(f(\\frac{3}{2})=8\\)。。","id":"import-polynomial-p009","subcategory":"theorems","skill":"poly-direct-remainder","classification":{"version":"2026-10-21.1","basis":"evaluate polynomial at a divisor root","status":"rule-classified","originalTopic":"","sourceLevel":null},"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"formBasis":"Editorial prerequisite recommendation, not a source grade or syllabus certification.","source":"Imported collection; attribution not supplied","sourceZh":"匯入題集；原檔未提供出處","provenance":{"collection":"1013-webpage","sha256":"af56d2daa36f8615eb1f27152fec0951c1a10910ed81dc30f4d3366a6eaebcfd","topic":"polynomial","kind":"mc","sourceId":"P009","row":9,"set":"q-Q03","number":"Q1.","attribution":"not-supplied"},"answer":"D","options":{"A":"\\(-8\\)","B":"\\(-4\\)","C":"\\(4\\)","D":"\\(8\\)"},"optionsZh":{"A":"\\(-8\\)","B":"\\(-4\\)","C":"\\(4\\)","D":"\\(8\\)"},"course":"core","topicId":"polynomial","category":"mc"},{"stem":"Let \\(f(x)=3x^2-kx-2\\), where \\(k\\) is a constant. If \\(f(x)\\) is divisible by \\(3x+1\\), find the remainder when \\(f(x)\\) is divided by \\(x-k\\).","stemZh":"設 \\(f(x)=3x^2-kx-2\\)，其中 \\(k\\) 為常數。若 \\(f(x)\\) 可被 \\(3x+1\\) 整除，求 \\(f(x)\\) 被 \\(x-k\\) 除時的餘式。","hint":"The factor \\(3x+1\\) gives \\(x=-\\frac{1}{3}\\): \\[ f\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{k}{3}-2=0, \\] so \\(k=5\\).","hintZh":"\\(3x+1\\) 是因式，先代 \\(x=-\\frac{1}{3}\\)： \\[ f\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{k}{3}-2=0, \\] 故 \\(k=5\\)","solution":"The factor \\(3x+1\\) gives \\(x=-\\frac{1}{3}\\): \\[ f\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{k}{3}-2=0, \\] so \\(k=5\\). The required remainder is \\(f(5)=48\\).","solutionZh":"\\(3x+1\\) 是因式，先代 \\(x=-\\frac{1}{3}\\)： \\[ f\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{k}{3}-2=0, \\] 故 \\(k=5\\)。所求餘式是 \\(f(5)=75-25-2=48\\)。。","id":"import-polynomial-p010","subcategory":"theorems","skill":"poly-multiple-conditions","classification":{"version":"2026-10-21.1","basis":"combine zero remainder and specified remainder","status":"rule-classified","originalTopic":"","sourceLevel":null},"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"formBasis":"Editorial prerequisite recommendation, not a source grade or syllabus certification.","source":"Imported collection; attribution not supplied","sourceZh":"匯入題集；原檔未提供出處","provenance":{"collection":"1013-webpage","sha256":"af56d2daa36f8615eb1f27152fec0951c1a10910ed81dc30f4d3366a6eaebcfd","topic":"polynomial","kind":"mc","sourceId":"P010","row":10,"set":"q-Q03","number":"Q2.","attribution":"not-supplied"},"answer":"B","options":{"A":"\\(5\\)","B":"\\(48\\)","C":"\\(98\\)","D":"\\(102\\)"},"optionsZh":{"A":"\\(5\\)","B":"\\(48\\)","C":"\\(98\\)","D":"\\(102\\)"},"course":"core","topicId":"polynomial","category":"mc"},{"stem":"Let \\(f(x)=x^2-hx+k\\), where \\(h\\) and \\(k\\) are constants. If \\(f(x)\\) is divisible by \\(2x-h\\), find the remainder when \\(f(x)\\) is divided by \\(2x+h\\).","stemZh":"設 \\(f(x)=x^2-hx+k\\)，其中 \\(h,k\\) 為常數。若 \\(f(x)\\) 可被 \\(2x-h\\) 整除，求 \\(f(x)\\) 被 \\(2x+h\\) 除時的餘式。","hint":"","hintZh":"","solution":"Since \\(2x-h\\) is a factor, \\(f(\\frac h2)=0\\), giving \\(k=\\frac{h^2}{4}\\). The root of \\(2x+h\\) is \\(-\\frac h2\\), hence \\[ f\\left(-\\frac h2\\right)=\\frac{h^2}{4}+\\frac{h^2}{2}+\\frac{h^2}{4}=h^2. \\]","solutionZh":"\\(2x-h\\) 是因式，故 \\(f(\\frac h2)=0\\)，所以 \\[ \\frac{h^2}{4}-\\frac{h^2}{2}+k=0\\Rightarrow k=\\frac{h^2}{4}. \\] 除式 \\(2x+h\\) 的 root 是 \\(-\\frac h2\\)，故 \\[ f\\left(-\\frac h2\\right)=\\frac{h^2}{4}+\\frac{h^2}{2}+\\frac{h^2}{4}=h^2. \\] 。","id":"import-polynomial-p011","subcategory":"theorems","skill":"poly-multiple-conditions","classification":{"version":"2026-10-21.1","basis":"combine zero remainder and specified remainder","status":"rule-classified","originalTopic":"","sourceLevel":null},"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"formBasis":"Editorial prerequisite recommendation, not a source grade or syllabus certification.","source":"Imported collection; attribution not supplied","sourceZh":"匯入題集；原檔未提供出處","provenance":{"collection":"1013-webpage","sha256":"af56d2daa36f8615eb1f27152fec0951c1a10910ed81dc30f4d3366a6eaebcfd","topic":"polynomial","kind":"mc","sourceId":"P011","row":11,"set":"q-Q03","number":"Q3.","attribution":"not-supplied"},"answer":"D","options":{"A":"\\(0\\)","B":"\\(\\frac{h^2}{2}\\)","C":"\\(-h^2\\)","D":"\\(h^2\\)"},"optionsZh":{"A":"\\(0\\)","B":"\\(\\frac{h^2}{2}\\)","C":"\\(-h^2\\)","D":"\\(h^2\\)"},"editorialCorrections":[{"field":"hintZh","reason":"Malformed optional source hint withheld; question and solution retained."}],"course":"core","topicId":"polynomial","category":"mc"},{"stem":"Let \\(p(x)=ax^4+4x^2-3x+b\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are non-zero constants. When \\(p(x)\\) is divided by \\(3x-2\\), the remainder is \\(7\\). Find the remainder when \\(p(x)\\) is divided by \\(3x+2\\).","stemZh":"設 \\(p(x)=ax^4+4x^2-3x+b\\)，其中 \\(a,b\\) 為非零常數。當 \\(p(x)\\) 被 \\(3x-2\\) 除時餘式為 \\(7\\)。求 \\(p(x)\\) 被 \\(3x+2\\) 除時的餘式。","hint":"The roots of \\(3x-2\\) and \\(3x+2\\) are \\(\\frac{2}{3}\\) and \\(-\\frac{2}{3}\\).","hintZh":"\\(3x-2\\) 與 \\(3x+2\\) 的 root 分別是 \\(\\frac{2}{3}\\) 與 \\(-\\frac{2}{3}\\)","solution":"The roots of \\(3x-2\\) and \\(3x+2\\) are \\(\\frac{2}{3}\\) and \\(-\\frac{2}{3}\\). The even-power terms agree, while \\(-3x\\) increases by \\(4\\). Thus \\[ p\\left(-\\frac{2}{3}\\right)=p\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)+4=11. \\]","solutionZh":"\\(3x-2\\) 與 \\(3x+2\\) 的 root 分別是 \\(\\frac{2}{3}\\) 與 \\(-\\frac{2}{3}\\)。偶次項在兩個 input 的值相同；一次項 \\(-3x\\) 則由 \\(-2\\) 變為 \\(2\\)，增加 \\(4\\)。所以 \\[ p\\left(-\\frac{2}{3}\\right)=p\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)+4=11. \\] 。","id":"import-polynomial-p012","subcateg